  "definition_ja": "曲線が鋭く尖っている点。左右から近づくときの接線の傾きが +∞ と −∞ に発散する（y = x^(2/3) の原点など）。",
  "definition_en": "A sharp point on a graph where the slopes from the left and from the right go to +∞ and −∞, as for y = x^(2/3) at the origin.",
  "latex": null,
  "spoken_en": null,
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "y equals x to the two-thirds has a cusp at the origin, so it's not differentiable there.",
